<title>CHINA: UBS sets warrants on HK's China-Affiliated index.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on HK's China-Affiliated index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland Hong Kong branch said on Thursday it had launched 300 million American-style call warrants on the Hang Seng China-Affiliated Corporations Index.</p>
<p>Five thousand warrants control one index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$3,383.70    PREMIUM	    25.86 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.175	 GEARING	    3.87x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   28.MAY.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	  17.JUL.97	LISTING DATE     31.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	EXER LOT	   10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$3,383.70</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
